# --- rotinas e continuacoes nomeadas na revisao de documentacao (ordem de endereco) ---
label 3B:E181 PortraitLoadPalettes
comment 3B:E181 loads fighter's 3 palettes (9 colors) from bank $3C tables
label 3B:E20F PortraitDecodeChunk
comment 3B:E20F PortraitBuild loop: decodes a pixel block and writes to ram_034E
label 3B:E28A VersusLoadStage
comment 3B:E28A loads VS screen stage: RLE, attributes and ground data
label 3B:E377 RoundInitLoadStage
comment 3B:E377 loads stage palette and zeros camera/ground at round start
label 3B:E3F5 PpuWrite64
comment 3B:E3F5 copies 64 raw bytes (two nametable lines) to PPUDATA
label 3B:E428 FadeOutStep
comment 3B:E428 fade-out step: waits vblank, marks palette and handles title CHR swap
label 3B:E47E FadeOutDarken
comment 3B:E47E prepares darkening of 24 colors (Y=$17) and falls into loop
label 3B:E480 FadeOutDarkenLoop
comment 3B:E480 darkens one palette color by a step according to fade step
label 3B:E0A0 PortraitLoadPalettesLoop
comment 3B:E0A0 palette copy loop inside PortraitLoadPalettes
label 3B:E131 FighterFlipSet
comment 3B:E131 sets mirror bit (FighterFlip) of fighter
label 3B:E165 PortraitPaletteCopyLoop
comment 3B:E165 copy loop of 3 palette bytes to ram_0300/0303/0306
label 3B:F27F DrawProjectile
comment 3B:F27F draws fighter's projectile (hadouken)
label 3B:F2B5 DrawProjectileSprite
comment 3B:F2B5 draws projectile sprite in OAM
label 3B:F315 DrawMetaspritePosition
comment 3B:F315 positions a metasprite group on screen
label 3B:F324 DrawMetaspriteGroupLoop
comment 3B:F324 metasprite group loop
label 3B:F331 DrawMetaspriteWriteOAM
comment 3B:F331 writes a sprite to OAM
label 3B:F356 DrawMetaspriteEnd
comment 3B:F356 end of metasprite drawing
label 3B:F364 SelectDrawBlinkDraw
comment 3B:F364 draws blinking fighter on selection screen
label 3B:F37D SelectScreenBuildPaletteLoop
comment 3B:F37D palette copy loop in selection screen build
label 3B:E4D8 FadeInPrepare
comment 3B:E4D8 saves original palette to FadePalette and clears colors for fade-in
label 3B:E59D RoundIntro_HudRowP1
comment 3B:E59D P1 label: 'P1' fixed if human, otherwise starts scrolling text
label 3B:E5C3 RoundIntro_HudRowP2
comment 3B:E5C3 P2 label: 'P2' fixed if human, otherwise starts scrolling text
label 3B:E5E9 RoundIntro_HudBars
comment 3B:E5E9 initializes energy bars and clock digits
label 3B:E63E RoundIntro_DrawNames
comment 3B:E63E writes fighter names to nametable (2 lines)
label 3B:E689 HudUpdate
comment 3B:E689 updates HUD: energy, clock and warnings (every 32 frames)
label 3B:E7A5 HudWarnLowHp
comment 3B:E7A5 flashes low HP warning (HP < $2C) every 8 frames
label 3B:E7C6 HudWarnLowHpDraw
comment 3B:E7C6 draws low HP warning for fighter X
label 3B:E98C NmiFightVram_Health
comment 3B:E98C sends energy bars and clock to PPU in NMI
label 3B:EAF2 VersusDraw
comment 3B:EAF2 builds VS screen: RLE background, portraits and names
label 3B:EBF2 VersusDrawFighters
comment 3B:EBF2 draws both fighters and names on VS screen
label 3B:ECE1 WinQuoteWait
comment 3B:ECE1 waits (2 or 3) x 64 frames per RoundResult and fades
label 3B:ED24 WinQuoteLineStart
comment 3B:ED24 start of winner's quote: Y=0
label 3B:ED26 WinQuoteLineLoop
comment 3B:ED26 copies the two 22-character quote lines to ram_03AF..
label 3B:EE38 PortraitSetupP1
comment 3B:EE38 prepares P1 portrait (palette, tiles and name)
label 3B:EE6B PortraitLoadPalettesP1
comment 3B:EE6B loads P1 palettes and marks PaletteDirty
label 3B:EEB6 PortraitBuildP1
comment 3B:EEB6 builds P1 portrait: decodes, saves pointer and loads tiles
label 3B:EEE0 PortraitTilesP1
comment 3B:EEE0 sends P1 portrait tiles to CHR
label 3B:EF24 PortraitSetupP2
comment 3B:EF24 prepares P2 portrait (palette, tiles and name)
label 3B:EF57 PortraitLoadPalettesP2
comment 3B:EF57 loads P2 palettes and marks PaletteDirty
label 3B:EF5C PortraitPalCopyP2
comment 3B:EF5C copies P2's 3 palettes (ram_0309/030C/030F) to PaletteBuf
label 3B:EF92 PortraitBuildP2
comment 3B:EF92 builds P2 portrait and draws it
label 3B:EFD3 PortraitDrawName
comment 3B:EFD3 draws fighter name on portrait (P1/P2 per zp_D5)
label 3B:F02E NmiVsPortraitUpload
comment 3B:F02E NMI: sends portrait tiles from buffer ram_034E (step 6)
label 3B:F225 NmiVsQuoteUpload
comment 3B:F225 NMI: sends current character of winner's quote
label 3B:F24A AiScriptInit
comment 3B:F24A starts fighter AI script: reads fiche pointer and zeroes state
label 3B:F2E3 OamHideRestFill
comment 3B:F2E3 fills OamBuf with $FE starting from X (continuation of OamHideRest)
label 3B:F2FB DrawMetasprite_Group
comment 3B:F2FB metasprite loop: reads quantity, dx, dy and tiles of each group
label 3B:F317 DrawMetasprite_Position
comment 3B:F317 positions group: dx/dy added to base, mirroring if zp_DD
label 3B:F359 SelectDrawBlink
comment 3B:F359 blinks selection fighter in alternate frames (FrameCounter bit 0)
label 3B:F36C SelectDrawFighter
comment 3B:F36C draws selection fighter and hides rest of OAM
label 3B:F376 SelectScreenBuild
comment 3B:F376 builds selection screen: palettes and background
label 3B:F71C RoundIntroDraw
comment 3B:F71C draws round intro fighter (RoundNumber/RoundStep) and 'FIGHT'
label 3B:F85C RoundEndDrawCenter
comment 3B:F85C positions and draws fighter at center of round end
label 3B:F8B5 RoundEndDraw
comment 3B:F8B5 draws round end fighter from pointer in zp_D9
label 3B:F8D3 PaletteFlashStart
comment 3B:F8D3 lights stage palette (colors 15-17) for round flash
label 3B:F8E6 PaletteFlashRestore
comment 3B:F8E6 restores stage palette after flash

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
