label 3B:E410 FadeOutMinTbl
comment 3B:E410 fade-out: lower bound per step (10 steps)
label 3B:E41A FadeInMaxTbl
comment 3B:E41A fade-in: upper bound per step (6 bytes; step 6 is a no-op, see tasks/DATA_NAMING_3B.md)
label 3B:E420 FadeInMinTbl
comment 3B:E420 fade-in: lower bound per step (6 bytes)
