label 37:E394 TitleDrawPushStart
comment 37:E394 restaura as 11 cores do PRESS START no PPU ($2ACB) durante o fade do titulo
label 37:E40B SfxPlayByState
comment 37:E40B sound effect by state class: sfx number from StateClassSfxTbl[class], stream offset from SfxChannelOfs[slot]
label 37:E6DD _FT2UpdateEnvelopes
comment 37:E6DD loop of 5 voices: updates volume envelopes (X=0)
label 37:E6DF _FT2EnvProcess
comment 37:E6DF processes voice X envelope: counter ram_010E and pointer
label 37:E6F6 _FT2EnvReadValue
comment 37:E6F6 reads envelope value; $80-$FF becomes $40-$7F (volume offset)
label 37:E719 _FT2UpdateSound
comment 37:E719 advances global vibrato phase (ram_046A, 0..10)
label 37:E8B5 _FT2ChannelPitch
comment 37:E8B5 calculates voice pitch: if no slide, loads current note from _FT2NoteTable
label 37:E940 _FT2SlideToNote
comment 37:E940 slide/portamento: loads target pitch when displacement zeroes
label 37:E9CA _FT2PitchCompare
comment 37:E9CA compares current pitch with target: returns 2 if equal, 0/1 if below/above
label 37:E9E8 _FT2LoadNotePitch
comment 37:E9E8 loads current note target pitch into ram_0477/0478
label 37:E9F9 _FT2Vibrato
comment 37:E9F9 applies vibrato: depth ram_0467 and phase ram_046A add to pitch
label 37:EB26 _FT2ReadByte
comment 37:EB26 reads a byte from channel pointer and advances 16-bit pointer
label 37:EBCA _FT2NoteShiftUp
comment 37:EBCA command $6E: raises note by N semitons (reads displacement)
label 37:EBCD _FT2ShiftUpReadNote
comment 37:EBCD reads next non-command byte of sequence (note)
label 37:EBCF _FT2ShiftUpNext
comment 37:EBCF decodes byte: $00 ends, >= $58 is command, otherwise note
label 37:EBE4 _FT2NoteShiftApply
comment 37:EBE4 applies note displacement: writes new note and slide mode 4
label 37:EC20 _FT2NoteShiftDown
comment 37:EC20 command $6F: lowers note by N semitons
label 37:EC23 _FT2ShiftDownReadNote
comment 37:EC23 reads next non-command byte of sequence (note)
label 37:EC4C _FT2ReadShift
comment 37:EC4C reads note displacement ($6E/$6F): low = steps, high = mode
label 37:EC65 _FT2PlainNote
comment 37:EC65 simple note: writes index to ram_010A and turns off fixed tuning mode
label 37:EC91 _FT2SpecialCode
comment 37:EC91 commands $70-$7F: instrument/volume (bit 0 = volume, otherwise instrument)
label 37:ED18 _FT2ReadParam
comment 37:ED18 reads a byte from pointer and advances (command parameter)
label 37:EDE6 _FT2SfxReadByte
comment 37:EDE6 reads sfx script byte: $80+ = command, $00 = end
label 37:EE0E _FT2SfxAdvance
comment 37:EE0E advances sfx pointer (Y and current offset)
label 37:EE1A _FT2SfxUpdateBuf
comment 37:EE1A copies sfx parameters to channel variables (volume, etc.)
label 37:EF27 _FT2ScaleVolume
comment 37:EF27 scales volume (A) by voice attenuation and returns minimum 1 (0 = mute)
label 37:EF92 SelectInit
comment 37:EF92 inicia a tela de selecao: carrega a musica $29 e zera a escolha
label 37:EFC9 SelectCheckDone
comment 37:EFC9 se os dois jogadores ja escolheram, retorna; senao continua
label 37:F093 SelectDrawCurrent
comment 37:F093 desenha o retrato e o nome do lutador atual na selecao
label 37:F0CB SelectLoopNext
comment 37:F0CB proximo lutador: volta ao inicio do laco da selecao
label 37:F0CE SelectReturn
comment 37:F0CE fim do laco da selecao: retorna
label 37:F0CF SelectFighterIntro
comment 37:F0CF entrada do lutador escolhido: prepara paleta, sprite e som da selecao
label 37:F19E SelectWaitEnd
comment 37:F19E espera o fim da animacao (contador zp_EB) e faz o fade para o VS
label 37:F1CC SelectReadInput
comment 37:F1CC le os dois controles (JoyPollSafe) e processa a escolha de cada jogador
label 37:F1E0 SelectPlayerInput
comment 37:F1E0 processa a entrada do jogador X (pula se for CPU)
label 37:F227 SelectMoveLeft
comment 37:F227 esquerda na borda: move o cursor para o lutador anterior
label 37:F264 SelectConfirm
comment 37:F264 A na borda: confirma o lutador atual (P1/P2)
# Ken jogavel: a comparacao original so' aceitava Ryu (0). Passa a aceitar 0 e 1 (Ken); 2..9 seguem bloqueados.
patch 37:F06B C9 02 90 07
comment 37:F06B Ryu (0) e Ken (1) confirmam; os demais seguem bloqueados
# Mapa de selecao: o narrador anuncia o Japao (ram_03B5 = 0, destino = Ryu). O pisca-pisca deve
# ficar na posicao do Japao (indice 0), nao na dos EUA (indice 4, posicao do Ken). SelectCursorXTbl sao
# as colunas X e SelectCursorYTbl as linhas Y; o indice 4 (Ken) e' o byte SelectCursorYTbl+4. O sprite do Ken no mapa
# (SelectFlagXTbl/SelectFlagYTbl) nao muda: so' a bandeira piscante aponta para o destino.
label 37:F27B SelectNextPlayer
comment 37:F27B passa ao outro jogador (X=1 -> 0) ou encerra
label 37:F57E TitleLoop
comment 37:F57E laco do titulo: zera rolagem e espera o START
label 37:F5F8 TitleScrollSet
comment 37:F5F8 grava X nas duas portas de rolagem e volta ao laco do titulo
label 37:F670 TitleBlinkPushStart
comment 37:F670 pisca o PRESS START alternando a cor 10 da paleta
