# Ken playable: the anti-air dispatch at $8FDC-$8FE8 uses the RTS trick on D00_9148, indexed by
# FighterChar,y. The table has ONE entry (2 bytes) and index advances 1 at a time, so only Ryu (0)
# works; for Ken (1) the bytes read are $91/$A4 -> target $A491 -> the RTS falls on $A492 ($02 = JAM) and
# CPU halts (infinite halt). Since this delivery's AI is always Ryu's, we fix index at 0
# (LDA abs,Y -> LDA abs): any opponent uses RyuAiAntiAir, exactly as in Ryu-vs-Ryu.
patch 00:8FE0 AD
patch 00:8FE4 AD
comment 00:8FE0 all opponents use RyuAiAntiAir (D00_9148 has a single entry)
comment 00:8FE4 same: without indexing by character, RTS-trick doesn't fall on $A492 (JAM)
label 00:8F46 RyuAiThink
block 00:8F46 ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
block 00:8F46 IA do Ryu (codigo nativo dentro do banco de dados do personagem). Decide pelo estado e distancia do
block 00:8F46 oponente e sorteia (Random) qual roteiro de IA disparar.


